      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "Small field but great race. LITTLEBOURKESTREET (4) found one better last time in a strong form race here over 11000m, continuing the good form this time in. Down in weight and suspect this easier. Go close. MONTJUIC MAGIC (1) lines up for the hat-trick after a strong win last time over 1300m here, scoring by 0.8 lengths. Hard to fault and will take catching again. IF I WAS YOU (5) finished third last time out over this course and distance, travelling towards the tail before winding up strongly in the dying stages. Has a win and three minor placings at this journey from six starts and has to be respected. STARZAM (3) ran below expectations last start, finishing sixth and beaten 4.5 lengths at this track over 1200m. Can do much better this time. PHYSICAL GRAFFITI (2) was in great form before a spell and goes well fresh. Don't underestimate.",
